This repository contains original scripts, measurements and documentation.

It does NOT redistribute any upstream source. `patches/patch_ple.py` is a small script that
edits a local copy of a file extracted from the vLLM container at run time; the vLLM source
itself is not included here.

Upstream projects referenced:
  vLLM                  Apache-2.0   https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm
  Qwen3.8-Flash-Next    see model card on HuggingFace (Qwen)
  Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4  see model card on HuggingFace (RadixArk), quantized with
                        NVIDIA TensorRT Model Optimizer (nvidia-modelopt 0.46.0)

Model weights are not redistributed. Benchmark numbers were measured on the author's own
hardware and are reported as measured, including the cases that failed.
